></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,08:51:50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2jz.o7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9ali 3la jalkom wlit haka</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_flitox.#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,08:52:29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2jz.o7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tsma flitox mz3o9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2o.e7#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,08:52:51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_abdou_suii.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">&lt;@1142540508183416883&gt; واش تقذف ياخو</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2jz.o7#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,08:53:40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">porkifiable</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The schooling that children undergo is based on the false belief that one cannot survive without being a slave.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,08:54:24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2jz.o7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">المني</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_abdou_suii.#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,08:59:32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_abdou_suii.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">&lt;@1142540508183416883&gt; ابعثلنا شوي لي ميمز مقودين</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2jz.o7#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,09:03:14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_flitox.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Can u stfu?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">porkifiable#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,09:03:48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_flitox.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yazbi t9ol 7na chdinah wlbsnalo kilota🗿</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2jz.o7#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,09:13:45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">vv_sr7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">وش يا شبيبة</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,09:14:05</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">vv_sr7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">سلام عليكم ورحمة الله وبركاته</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,09:15:26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">porkifiable</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">First, the government should allow child labor and protect children's personal freedom to leave their parents or school, and legally transform the relationship between parents and children into an employment relationship. Secondly, the government should give money to children according to the growth of their academic level as shown in the exams, give them more financial possibilities to leave supervision, and avoid using school attendance rate as an indicator of this financial subsidy.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,09:19:29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2jz.o7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">N7inal 9lawih wrj3nah femboy</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_flitox.#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,09:19:56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2jz.o7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">&lt;@1169250247847972887&gt; kol sba7 nl9ah ba3t paragraphe</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">porkifiable#0、_flitox.#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,09:26:34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">porkifiable</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If the government's financial subsidies that I envision depend not only on test scores but also on attendance rates, then the government is not only rewarding academic level itself but also discipline itself; it will not only reward knowledge but also a culture, which is not necessarily a power that the government should have.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,09:28:06</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2jz.o7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">&lt;@1075754601220952217&gt; chikour m9wd</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">porkifiable#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-11-05,09:29:03</Data></Cell